# Instagram

Stage 1 loads `@efemer_flowers` and `@himmlhaus` into **`ingest_items`** (idempotent on `account:shortcode`). Categorization and public posts come later.

## Session

Store Jan’s Instagram `sessionid` in Secret Manager (never commit it):

| Item | Value |
|---|---|
| Project | `efemer-456414` |
| Secret | `instagram-session-id` |
| Accessor | `efemer-storage@efemer-456414.iam.gserviceaccount.com` |

Runtime reads GSM first, then `.secret/instagram.session`. Local file is seeded into GSM when GSM is empty.

Refresh the secret when Instagram checkpoints the session:

```bash
printf '%s' "$SESSIONID" | gcloud secrets versions add instagram-session-id \
  --project=efemer-456414 --account=jablunka@gmail.com --data-file=-
```

## Run (ingest jobs)

```bash
docker compose exec -T php php bin/cli.php jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.RefreshInstagram --args='{"account":"efemer_flowers","full":true}' -f
docker compose exec -T php php bin/cli.php jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.RefreshInstagram --args='{"account":"himmlhaus","full":true}' -f

# both accounts
docker compose exec -T php php bin/cli.php jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.RefreshInstagramAccounts --args='{"full":true}' -f

# offline dump under data/instagram
docker compose exec -T php php bin/cli.php jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.ImportInstagramDump -f
```

Production `instagram-archive` loops `jobs:loop …RefreshInstagramAccounts` every 6 hours.
